        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "国王は、密かに城外に使いを送り、情報を集めさせた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「この伝言、お城まで使いに頼むことはできますか？」",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼は、熟練した使いとして、幾度も危険な任務を成功させてきた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "familiar spirit",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "魔女は、使いを放って、遠くの村の様子を探らせた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "その古い伝説では、悪魔は使いを使役して、人々に災いをもたらすという。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "彼は、古文書に記された、使いを呼び出す呪文を唱え始めた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash-lite"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 4,
        "gloss": "use",
